# install.sh, uninstall.sh and the smoke test are bash, and a shell script with CRLF line
# endings dies on Linux and WSL with "bad interpreter: /usr/bin/env bash^M".
# core.autocrlf=true is the default on Windows installs of git, so pin the endings here
# rather than trusting every clone's local config.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
